# src/packages/control-ui/src/features/operations

## Purpose
Owns Control UI behavior for long-running or actionable daemon operations presented to the user.

## Contents
Contains operation-oriented hooks, state coordination, and feature components for starting, observing, or presenting operational work.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Consumes canonical API/transport contracts and shared UI primitives and is composed by application pages/routes.

## Invariants
Operation state transitions remain explicit, loading/error/cancellation are represented rather than hidden, duplicate side effects are avoided, and stale responses must not regress newer operation state.